<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Tail</ansi> mutation

A thick, muscular tail has grown from the base of your spine. It
grants a powerful sweep attack and can be fitted with attachments,
but makes wearing leg armor impossible.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Slightly improved dexterity — the tail provides balance and
  body awareness
  Unlocks the tail slot for wearable attachments
  Your trip attack becomes a powerful tailsweep with enhanced
  knockdown force

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced charisma — a tail is an unsettling sight to
  most people
  Leg armor cannot be worn — the tail makes leg slots incompatible

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Small

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
